	(text "This is the 6525 Tri-Port Interface chip. It was\nused in a few Commodore products like the CBM-II\ncomputers, the C64 IEEE cartridge, Amiga CDTV,\nand A570. They are rare, but it might be possible\nto find one or perhaps the design might be able to\nuse an INTEL 8255."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 32.258 120.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
